1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,140
This man sold everything he owned

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:03,930
to meet the woman of his dreams.

3
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,560
She was a widow with a farm,

4
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:07,710
and she promised the right man a home.

5
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:10,370
Three hundred thousand people followed her.

6
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:11,510
He actually went.

7
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:13,050
After two days on a bus,

8
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:14,880
he showed her photo to strangers.

9
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,747
Nobody had ever seen her.

10
00:00:16,767 --> 00:00:18,670
So he asked a radio station for help.

11
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:20,290
That's where he learned the truth:

12
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,440
she was never real.

13
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:23,100
She was made by AI.

14
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,360
Her creator says she was

15
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,067
only there to sell stuff.

16
00:00:26,087 --> 00:00:26,620
And him?

17
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:27,840
Back home, he said:

18
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:28,930
"I'll find another one.

19
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:29,750
Same place.

20
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:30,550
I'm going again."

21
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:32,380
[Ah sh*t, here we go again]
